      "writtenOn": "2026-08-10T14:52:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Valid point, and it has been addressed. Currently, we do not have a mechanism to provide users with detailed information when a request fails. For example, a video connection failure is only reflected as a Disconnected status in the web UI. Similarly, if the HID connection fails, users may still see the video stream but have no visibility into the HID status or the reason for the failure. We should consider enhancing error reporting to provide users with clearer and more actionable feedback.",
      "parentUuid": "87572662_01bfdf83",
      "revId": "bfc388ff71a1f8fa89f1dc3d552b02cb19499550",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
